{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "flammability_init_tuning",
  "spec": ["flammability 3", "flammability 4.1", "flammability 4.2", "flammability 8", "foundations 4.1"],
  "description": "Derived by hand from flammability 3, 4.1, 4.2 and 8. The constructor leaves the tuning fields 0, the global multiplier 0 and the cell iterator as constructed (prime-step, running, dirty, count 0, step 1). Init reads the tuning (code defaults first: summer 1.2, abandonment 1.1, no water 1.1, hotspot settings 196/8/16, random fire 0.01, no curve; tract size 1 and cycle 40 at every read), creates the adjusted grid 0x49D5B953 then the raw grid 0x49D5B964 with tract size 1 and all tracts 0, sets tractsPerDay = 64*64/40 = 102 and the iterator rectangle (0, 0, 63, 63) without resetting it (count stays 0). The global multiplier is not computed. A second Init does nothing. Shutdown shuts down both grids, deletes the curve and keeps the average. The shipped exemplar gives 1/1.5/1.25, settings 54/8/40, probability 5 and the curve (0,0)(39,0)(40,7)(50,15)(70,20)(100,25): f(40) = 7, f(45) = 11, f(60) = 17.5, f(>= 100) = 25. The hotspot settings are used only with exactly 3 values. The curve uses the 'delete' pattern (foundations 4.1): an absent property after a present one leaves no curve; [choice] a property with fewer than two values counts as absent.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "flam_env", "cells": [64, 64]},
    {"op": "flam_tuning", "none": true},
    {"op": "flam_create"},
    {"op": "flam_expect", "state": {"initialized": false, "global_multiplier": 0, "average": 0, "tract_size": 0, "cycle_period": 0,
      "summer_multiplier": 0, "hotspot_threshold": 0, "random_fire_probability": 0, "has_curve": false, "tracts_per_day": 0,
      "has_adjusted": false, "has_raw": false,
      "iterator": {"state": "running", "mode": 1, "dirty": 1, "rect": [0, 0, 0, 0], "count": 0, "index": 0, "step": 1}}},
    {"op": "flam_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flam_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "create_grid", "instance": "0x49D5B953", "size": 1},
      {"event": "create_grid", "instance": "0x49D5B964", "size": 1}]},
    {"op": "flam_expect", "state": {"initialized": true, "global_multiplier": 0, "count_x": 64, "count_z": 64, "tract_size": 1, "cycle_period": 40,
      "summer_multiplier": 1.2, "abandonment_multiplier": 1.1, "no_water_multiplier": 1.1,
      "hotspot_threshold": 196, "hotspot_radius": 8, "hotspot_min_weight": 16, "random_fire_probability": 0.01, "has_curve": false,
      "tracts_per_day": 102, "zoned_sum": 0, "zoned_count": 0, "has_adjusted": true, "has_raw": true,
      "iterator": {"state": "running", "dirty": 1, "rect": [0, 0, 63, 63], "count": 0, "index": 0, "step": 1}}},
    {"op": "flam_expect_grid", "grid": "adjusted", "instance": "0x49D5B953", "counts": [64, 64], "tract_size": 1, "all": 0},
    {"op": "flam_expect_grid", "grid": "raw", "instance": "0x49D5B964", "counts": [64, 64], "tract_size": 1, "all": 0},
    {"op": "flam_call", "method": "flammability_grid", "expect": "0x49D5B953"},
    {"op": "flam_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flam_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "flam_set", "state": {"average": 33}},
    {"op": "flam_shutdown", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flam_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "grid_shutdown", "instance": "0x49D5B953"},
      {"event": "grid_shutdown", "instance": "0x49D5B964"}]},
    {"op": "flam_expect", "state": {"initialized": false, "has_curve": false, "has_adjusted": false, "has_raw": false, "average": 33}},
    {"op": "flam_shutdown", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flam_expect_events", "events": []},

    {"op": "flam_tuning", "shipped": true},
    {"op": "flam_create"},
    {"op": "flam_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flam_expect", "state": {"summer_multiplier": 1, "abandonment_multiplier": 1.5, "no_water_multiplier": 1.25,
      "hotspot_threshold": 54, "hotspot_radius": 8, "hotspot_min_weight": 40, "random_fire_probability": 5, "has_curve": true,
      "tract_size": 1, "cycle_period": 40, "global_multiplier": 0}},
    {"op": "flam_call", "method": "curve", "args": [0], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "flam_call", "method": "curve", "args": [39], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "flam_call", "method": "curve", "args": [40], "expect": 7},
    {"op": "flam_call", "method": "curve", "args": [45], "expect": 11},
    {"op": "flam_call", "method": "curve", "args": [60], "expect": 17.5},
    {"op": "flam_call", "method": "curve", "args": [100], "expect": 25},
    {"op": "flam_call", "method": "curve", "args": [1000], "expect": 25},

    {"op": "flam_tuning", "shipped": true, "props": {"0x29B4013C": {"u32": [1, 2]}, "0xC9B40128": {"f32": 1.3}}, "remove": ["0x29B4013D", "0x29B4013E"]},
    {"op": "flam_create"},
    {"op": "flam_init"},
    {"op": "flam_expect", "state": {"summer_multiplier": 1.3, "hotspot_threshold": 196, "hotspot_radius": 8, "hotspot_min_weight": 16,
      "has_curve": false, "random_fire_probability": 0.01, "abandonment_multiplier": 1.5}},
    {"op": "flam_tuning", "props": {"0x29B4013C": {"u32": [10, 20, 30]}, "0x29B4013D": {"f32": [5]}}},
    {"op": "flam_create"},
    {"op": "flam_init"},
    {"op": "flam_expect", "state": {"hotspot_threshold": 10, "hotspot_radius": 20, "hotspot_min_weight": 30, "has_curve": false,
      "summer_multiplier": 1.2}}
  ]
}
